@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Presentation ownership and provided/required contracts
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

component "LC-02 Professional Presentation\nsource / independent drafts / publication manifests" as P
interface "Save / compare / apply / preview / publish\nprovided" as C
interface "Current authority\nrequired" as I
interface "Files protection / usability\nrequired" as F
component "Representation / Sharing\nrendition and viewer/link eligibility" as S
component "Applications\nindependent actual materials" as A
P -right- C
P -up-( I
P -left-( F
S --> C : exact permitted committed manifest
A --> C : exact permitted source/revision provenance
note bottom of P
 Logical modules, not separate profile/portfolio/theme microservices.
 CDN, analytics and external social sync are not selected.
end note

@enduml